    Client setup, schema conventions, row-level security, and the migration procedure. Use whenever a task touches the database — creating or modifying tables, writing migrations, querying data, or anything involving auth-adjacent data access.
    
    ## api-route-conventions (call getSkill("api-route-conventions") to load full content)
    Error shape, status codes, and the streaming/SSE pattern for backend routes. Use whenever writing or editing an API or server route.
    
    ## state-management-rules (call getSkill("state-management-rules") to load full content)
    When to use local component state vs. a shared/global store, and the conventions for each. Use whenever a task introduces new state, lifts existing state, or touches how data flows between components.
    
